## 8. Naming + housekeeping

- Class is named `EasyApiService` (TS convention) even though the user spells it "EasyAPIService" colloquially. Rename if preferred — single replace in [lib/easy-api/server.ts](lib/easy-api/server.ts).
- Domain types currently live as global ambient interfaces (`Project`, `Transaction`, etc.). When adding Easy-API-specific DTOs that diverge, **export them as named types** from the domain module rather than polluting the ambient namespace.
- Don't reuse `lib/firebase/*-actions.ts` filenames for Easy API — keep the layers visibly distinct (`lib/easy-api/projects.ts`, not `lib/easy-api/project-actions.ts`).

